//
// Lessons baked in:
//   #7 Singleton subscription race (a 2D prototype, 2026-05-26) —
//      UI that subscribed to Singleton.OnChanged in OnEnable hit a
//      race where Singleton.Awake hadn't yet run -> Instance was
